        "# 1. Problem Definition\n",
        "\n",
        "The project uses two prediction targets.\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Target 1**  forecast the **30-trading-day ahead log return** of gold  \n",
        "- **Target 2** forecast the **21-trading-day ahead realized volatility**\n",
        "\n",
        "The model stays  away from raw gold-price forecasts several years ahead. It focuses on shorter market behavior\t\tover the next month.\n",
        "\n",
        "- return over the next month  \n",
        "- volatility over the next  month  \n",
        "\n",
        "After the return forecast is produced, it can be converted into a price forecast with\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\hat{P}_{t+30} = P_t \\exp(\\hat{r}_{t,t+30})\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "This setup turns the  project into a two-output regression task\t\twith a clearer  target structure and a stronger  statistical basis.\n"
      ],
