        "## the daata gandling and exploratory data analysis for gold\n",
        "\n",
        "Just before we  fitted any forecasting model, the gold dataset was reviewed  for structure, quality, and possible errors. The file contains six fields, **Date, Open, High, Low, Close,** and **Volume**. This stage checks  whether the series is usable and it also describes its main patterns, and flags problems that may affect training.The dataset contains **6,399 daily records** which covers the period from **2000-08-30** to **2026-03-03**. The initial check found **zero missing values** and **zero duplicated rows**, a nd this  gives  a clean starting point. Nonetheless a deeper review was still needed, mainly due to the  financial files can contain pricing or formatting issues that simple missing-value checks may miss.\n",
