        "## 5. Experimental Design\n",
        "\n",
        "The experiments are set up around three questions.\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Can a sequence model give stronger forecasts than a plain feedforward baselined\n",
        "2. Do macroeconomic and geopolitical signals add useful information beyond gold’s own price history\n",
